  <p>Not everything we work on has a tidy label. A lot of it is the <a href="/specialties/life-transitions">life transitions</a> that rearrange everything at once: a career pivot, an empty nest, a move, a version of the future that quietly stopped being true. Steady footing while the ground shifts is its own kind of work.</p>
  <p>And some of this goes better on the move. Walking the coastline, side by side, the conversation tends to loosen in a way it rarely does across a desk. Beach Therapy is the same one-on-one work, just outdoors, with the ocean taking a little of the pressure off. Ask about it on your call.</p>
